    genuinely fits how you work — before you commit a year of preparation to one exam family — a session
    inside <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you test that fit properly.
  </p>

  <nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="Article sections">
